%% title: Состояния AIActionTask
%% kind: state
%% level: детали
%% refs: AT-CLASS, AT-CANCEL, AR-RESULT, DC-ACTION-STATUS
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> NotStarted: конструктор (context, runtime)
  NotStarted --> Running: Start() → runtime Running
  NotStarted --> Succeeded: Start() → runtime Succeeded
  NotStarted --> Failed: Start() → runtime Failed
  Running --> Running: Tick() → Running
  Running --> Succeeded: Tick() → Succeeded
  Running --> Failed: Tick() → Failed
  Running --> Cancelled: Cancel() → runtime.Cancel()
  Succeeded --> [*]: задача остаётся в AISystem до замены или смерти агента
  Failed --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
